            "zh": "留空则创建匿名 Job。无论是否命名，都会把当前 Beacon 进程塞进该 Job，且不会摘出来。",
            "en": "Empty creates an anonymous job. Either way the current Beacon process is assigned into it and not removed."
          }
        }
